---
---

<section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-36 px-6">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-32 items-center">

      <!-- Left: Big statement -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="animate-on-scroll font-heading font-light text-warm-black leading-[1.1]" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);">
          One Contract.<br/>
          <em class="text-gold not-italic">Everything</em><br/>
          Included.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Editorial explanation -->
      <div class="animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="w-8 h-px bg-gold mb-8"></div>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-warm-mid leading-relaxed font-light mb-8">
          Most contractors hand you a blueprint and tell you to figure out permits yourself. We don't.
          Saadi Construction Group manages your architectural plans, structural engineering, city permits,
          and full construction under a single contract.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-base text-warm-mid leading-relaxed font-light mb-12">
          One phone number. One schedule. One point of accountability — from your first call to the day you get your keys.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          {[
            'Architectural plans coordinated and delivered',
            'Structural engineering and city permit submission',
            'Full construction by our licensed team',
          ].map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="w-5 h-px bg-gold mt-3 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="font-body text-sm text-warm-dark font-light tracking-wide">{item}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Free Consultation</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
